        <div class="panel"><p>Yes. Email <a href="mailto:{{ page.metafields.global.email }}">{{ page.metafields.global.email }}</a> or call <a href="tel:+17043325222">{{ page.metafields.global.phone }}</a>. We require at least 48 hours notice for standard orders, and 1 to 2 months for elaborate cakes.</p></div>

