        <div class="panel"><p>Yes. Email <a href="mailto:{{ page.metafields.global.email }}">{{ page.metafields.global.email }}</a> or call <a href="tel:+19802588000">{{ page.metafields.global.phone }}</a>. We require at least 48 hours notice for standard orders, and 1 to 2 months for elaborate cakes.</p></div>

      {%- when 'noda' -%}
        <button class="accordion">When do you bake fresh daily at the NoDa location?</button>
        <div class="panel"><p>Everything is baked fresh every morning right here, ready and waiting when we open at 7am. Come early for the best selection.</p></div>

        <button class="accordion">Is there parking at your Jordan Place bakery?</button>
        <div class="panel"><p>{{ loc_parking }}</p></div>

        <button class="accordion">Is there seating at the NoDa cafe?</button>
        <div class="panel"><p>Yes. The NoDa cafe is a great spot to hang out, get work done, or catch up with friends. We have free WiFi and a creative, welcoming vibe that fits right in with the neighborhood.</p></div>

