        <div class="panel"><p>We regularly stock GF cheesecakes, chocolate soufflé cakes, and coconut macaroons at this location. Note: while these items are made without gluten, our bakeries are not dedicated GF facilities, so trace levels of gluten are possible.</p></div>

        <button class="accordion">How do I place a custom cake order at the NoDa location?</button>
        <div class="panel"><p>Email <a href="mailto:{{ page.metafields.global.email }}">{{ page.metafields.global.email }}</a> or call <a href="tel:+17049007305">{{ page.metafields.global.phone }}</a>. We require at least 48 hours notice for standard orders, and 1 to 2 months for elaborate cakes.</p></div>

    {%- endcase -%}

    <button class="accordion">Do you ship nationwide?</button>
    <div class="panel"><p>Yes. We ship select bakery goods <a href="/pages/shop">nationwide</a>, including our <a href="/pages/cake-jars">Cake Jars</a> and specialty baked goods. We also offer <a href="/pages/catering">catering services</a> and local delivery.</p></div>

    <button class="accordion">Are your products made from scratch?</button>
    <div class="panel"><p>Yes, everything. We bake in small batches daily using all-natural ingredients with no artificial flavorings, preservatives, dough conditioners, or bleached or bromated flour.</p></div>

    <button class="accordion">How far in advance do I need to place an order?</button>
    <div class="panel"><p>We require at least 48 hours after confirming your request to prepare your order. For elaborate cakes and large catering orders, one to two months in advance is recommended.</p></div>

    <button class="accordion">Is Sunflour a franchise or chain?</button>
    <div class="panel"><p>No. We are a local, family-owned bakery with five locations in the Charlotte area. Everything is made fresh onsite and our staff rotate between stores to ensure consistency of products and service.</p></div>
  </div>

  <div class="loc-newsletter">
    <div class="loc-newsletter__inner">
      <h3 class="loc-newsletter__title">Join the Sunflour Family!</h3>
      <p class="loc-newsletter__offer">Save 10% On Your First Order!</p>

      {%- comment -%}
        TODO: Replace the placeholder form below with your Klaviyo embed code.
        Log in to Klaviyo > Sign-up Forms, create or select a form,
        and paste the embed snippet here in place of this block.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="loc-newsletter__form-placeholder">
        <input type="email" class="loc-newsletter__input" placeholder="Enter your email" aria-label="Email address">
        <button type="button" class="loc-newsletter__btn">Subscribe</button>
      </div>
      <p class="loc-newsletter__disclaimer">No spam or state secrets, ever!</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<script>
(function() {
  var acc = document.querySelectorAll('.loc-faq .accordion');
  for (var i = 0; i < acc.length; i++) {
    acc[i].addEventListener('click', function() {
      this.classList.toggle('active');
      var panel = this.nextElementSibling;
      if (panel.style.maxHeight) {
        panel.style.maxHeight = null;
      } else {
        panel.style.maxHeight = panel.scrollHeight + 'px';
      }
    });
  }
})();
</script>

<style>
  /* ---- Hero ---- */
  .loc-hero {
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    min-height: 420px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .loc-hero__overlay {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 420px;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 60px 24px;
  }
  .loc-hero__content {
    max-width: 760px;
    text-align: center;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.52);
    padding: 40px 48px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .loc-hero__h1 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .loc-hero__h2 {
    color: #f5e6c8;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 2.4vw, 26px);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .loc-hero__tagline {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.6vw, 20px);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---- Essentials Card ---- */
  .loc-essentials {
    background: #faf6ef;
    padding: 48px 24px;
  }
  .loc-essentials__card {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5d9c0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 36px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }
  .loc-essentials__map iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 360px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: block;
  }
  .loc-essentials__info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .loc-info-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .loc-info-row__icon {
    width: 20px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: #c0392b;
    margin-top: 2px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .loc-info-row__text a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .loc-info-row__text a:hover {
    color: #c0392b;
  }
  .loc-btn-cluster {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .loc-btn {
    display: block;
    background-color: #d4a843;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 13px 20px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.2s;
  }
  .loc-btn:hover {
    background-color: #b8902f;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .loc-btn i {
    margin-right: 6px;
  }

  /* ---- Social Proof ---- */
  .loc-social-proof {
    background: #fdf9f4;
    padding: 56px 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .loc-social-proof__inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .loc-stars {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .loc-social-proof__quote {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #333;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    quotes: none;
  }
  .loc-social-proof__attribution {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #777;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .loc-social-proof__cta {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #c0392b;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .loc-social-proof__cta:hover {
    color: #922b21;
  }

  /* ---- FAQ + Newsletter Grid ---- */
  .loc-bottom-grid {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 24px 72px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .loc-faq__title {
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 28px);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  /* Accordion */
  button.accordion {
    background-color: #fff;
    color: #222;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 16px 44px 16px 16px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0d5c0;
    outline: none;
    transition: background-color 0.2s;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    position: relative;
    display: block;
  }
  button.accordion::after {
    content: '+';
    position: absolute;
    right: 16px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #c0392b;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  button.accordion.active::after {
    content: '\2212';
  }
  button.accordion:hover,
  button.accordion.active {
    background-color: #faf6ef;
  }
  .panel {
    padding: 0 16px;
    background-color: #fff;
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.25s ease-out;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #444;
  }
  .panel p {
    margin: 14px 0;
  }

  /* Newsletter */
  .loc-newsletter__inner {
    background: #faf6ef;
    border: 1px solid #e5d9c0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .loc-newsletter__title {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .loc-newsletter__offer {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #555;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .loc-newsletter__form-placeholder {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .loc-newsletter__input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 15px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .loc-newsletter__btn {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #d4a843;
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    padding: 13px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.2s;
  }
  .loc-newsletter__btn:hover {
    background-color: #b8902f;
  }
  .loc-newsletter__disclaimer {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #888;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
  }

  /* ---- Responsive ---- */
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .loc-essentials__card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 24px;
      gap: 28px;
    }
    .loc-essentials__map iframe {
      height: 260px;
    }
    .loc-bottom-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .loc-newsletter {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .loc-hero__overlay {
      padding: 48px 16px;
    }
    .loc-essentials {
      padding: 32px 16px;
    }
    .loc-bottom-grid {
      padding: 40px 16px 56px;
    }
  }
</style>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BakeryOrCafe",
  "name": {{ page.metafields.global.title | default: shop.name | json }},
  "url": {{ canonical_url | json }},
  {%- if page.metafields.global.phone != blank and page.metafields.global.phone != '-' -%}
  "telephone": {{ page.metafields.global.phone | json }},
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if page.metafields.global.email != blank -%}
  "email": {{ page.metafields.global.email | json }},
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if page.metafields.global.address != blank -%}
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "streetAddress": {{ page.metafields.global.address | json }},
    {%- if loc_handle == 'harrisburg-nc-bakery' -%}
    "addressLocality": "Harrisburg",
    {%- else -%}
    "addressLocality": "Charlotte",
    {%- endif -%}
    "addressRegion": "NC",
    "addressCountry": "US"
  },
  {%- endif -%}
  "openingHours": "Mo-Su 07:00-16:00",
  {%- if page.metafields.global.outside_image != blank -%}
  "image": {{ page.metafields.global.outside_image | json }},
  {%- elsif page.metafields.global.inside_image != blank -%}
  "image": {{ page.metafields.global.inside_image | json }},
  {%- endif -%}
  "parentOrganization": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": {{ shop.name | json }},
    "url": {{ request.origin | json }}
  },
  "servesCuisine": "Bakery",
  "priceRange": "$"
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "When are you open?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We are open every day from 7:00am to 4:00pm."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you ship nationwide?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. We ship select bakery goods nationwide, including our Cake Jars and specialty baked goods. We also offer local delivery and catering services."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Are your products made from scratch?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes, everything. We bake in small batches daily using all-natural ingredients with no artificial flavorings, preservatives, dough conditioners, or bleached or bromated flour."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you offer gluten-free options?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. We regularly stock GF cheesecakes, chocolate soufflé cakes, and coconut macaroons. While these items are made without gluten, our bakeries are not dedicated GF facilities, so trace levels of gluten are possible."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you make custom cakes?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. We make custom cakes for weddings, birthdays, graduations, and celebrations of all kinds. We also make and ship custom packs of Cake Jars nationwide."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How far in advance do I need to place an order?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We require at least 48 hours after confirming your request to prepare your order. For elaborate cakes and large catering orders, one to two months in advance is recommended."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is Sunflour a franchise or chain?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. We are a local, family-owned bakery with five locations in the Charlotte area. Everything is made fresh onsite and our staff rotate between stores to ensure consistency."
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>

